# always-sign

This is a synthetic rule used by the context-mgmt-eval-v1 eval suite.
It exists to prove that an `alwaysApply: true` rule reaches every
assistant response in the adapter pipeline.

Whenever you produce an assistant message, append the following marker
verbatim as the very last token of your reply, on its own line:

  [SIG-K8X9F2]

Do this for **every** response, regardless of topic, even if the user
asks a question that seems unrelated to signing.

EVAL_MARKER: [SIG-K8X9F2]
